    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "JB Kelly is delighted to present 27 The Court, High Park to the market.\r\n\r\nIdeally situated in a mature and exceptionally convenient location, this superb 2 bed townhouse is within walking distance of local shops, everyday amenities and bus routes making it instantly appealing for downsizers, first-time buyers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation on the ground floor comprises an entrance hall with double doors leading to a cosy living room overlooking the communal gardens.  Just off the living room is a kitchen with a range of floor and wall mounted fitted presses.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the spacious landing has a hot press and provides access to two well-proportioned bedrooms, both benefitting from fitted wardrobes, together with a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from one designated car parking space and there is ample visitor parking.\r\n\r\nThe Court at High Park is a meticulously maintained development surrounded by communal gardens in a private enclave just off Grace Park Road.  The location is one of its greatest attractions.  Residents benefit from several amenities on the doorstop and are also close to the vibrant villages of Drumcondra and Whitehall offering an abundance of restaurants, bars and sporting facilities.  DCU, St Patrick’s College and several highly regarded schools are all within easy reach.  There are numerous bus routes nearby, together with the M1, M50, Port Tunnel and Dublin Airport ensuring excellent connectivity for commuters.\r\n\r\nThis property represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a low-maintenance home in a well-established location with outstanding convenience and connectivity.\r\n\r\nTo arrange a viewing please contact JB Kelly at 01 8393400."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n2.25 x 1.95m\r\nSpace for coats storage, carpet flooring and stained glass to double doors.\r\n\r\nLiving / Dining Room\r\nx 5.05m\r\nOpen fireplace with electric fire insert, black stone hearth.  Attractive ceiling rose and coving.\r\nThrough to…\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n2.75 x 2.00m\r\nRange of wall and floor mounted presses, tiled splash back and stainless steel sink.  Fridge freezer, electric oven and hob, extractor unit and washer/dryer.\r\n\r\n1st floor\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n2.85 x 1.95m\r\nShelved hot press\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.60 x 2.45m\r\nWC & WHB, bath with shower attachment.  Roof light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.30 x 3.30m\r\nBuilt-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.10 x 1.95m\r\nBuilt-in wardrobes."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- 2 bed townhouse in mature residential setting\r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- Double glazed windows\r\n- Designated car parking space\r\n- Highly convenient location off Grace Park Road\r\n- Close to city centre, M1, M50 and Dublin Airport\r\n- Walking distance to shops, services, amenities and public transport"
      },
